WEBVTT

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.286
And so the Fates are seldom wrong,
no matter how they twist and wind.

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:35.976
It's you and I who make our fates --

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:39.976
we open up or close the gates
on the road ahead or the road behind."

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.525
Reminds me of another set of threes
that my dad tried to get across to us:

00:11:43.549 --> 00:11:46.642
Don't whine. Don't complain.
Don't make excuses.

00:11:46.666 --> 00:11:47.904
Just get out there,

00:11:47.928 --> 00:11:50.808
and whatever you're doing,
do it to the best of your ability.

00:11:50.832 --> 00:11:52.976
And no one can do more than that.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:55.881
I tried to get across, too, that --

00:11:55.905 --> 00:11:58.985
my opponents will tell you --
you never heard me mention winning.

00:11:59.009 --> 00:12:00.538
Never mention winning.